1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:06,020
24 donat, 36 kue. Dibagi rata ke kantong, tanpa sisa.

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,180
Paling banyak, berapa kantong?

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,850
Ani dan Budi mau jualan di bazar sekolah,

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,210
dan ingin kantong sebanyak mungkin.

5
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:15,420
Budi langsung coba 10 kantong.

6
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:19,200
Donatnya 2 per kantong, tapi sisa 4. Gagal!

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,180
Coba 8 kantong. Donatnya pas, 3 per kantong.

8
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:26,210
Tapi kuenya sisa 4. Gagal lagi!

9
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,690
Ani tersenyum.

10
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:32,310
Jumlah kantongnya harus bisa membagi habis 24,

11
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,730
dan juga 36. Itulah faktor persekutuan.

12
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,570
Kita tulis faktornya.

13
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:44,810
24: 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 12, 24.

14
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:52,530
36: 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 9, 12, 18, 36.

15
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:58,180
Yang ada di keduanya: 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 12.

16
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,170
Yang terbesar, 12!

17
00:01:00,170 --> 00:01:02,950
Inilah FPB: Faktor Persekutuan Terbesar.

18
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:05,560
Jadi, 12 kantong.

19
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:08,510
Tiap kantong berisi 2 donat dan 3 kue.

20
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:10,400
Pas, tidak ada sisa!

21
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,670
Tapi jangan tertukar dengan KPK.

22
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:14,500
Kalau membagi rata ke kelompok

23
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,680
sebanyak-banyaknya, pakai FPB.

24
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:19,970
Kalau mencari kapan bertemu lagi, pakai KPK.

25
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:22,970
12 kantong itu pun ludes terjual di bazar.

26
00:01:22,970 --> 00:01:24,380
Sekarang giliranmu.

27
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:27,070
18 pensil dan 30 penghapus,

28
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:29,930
dibagi rata ke beberapa anak, tanpa sisa.

29
00:01:29,930 --> 00:01:31,430
Paling banyak berapa anak?

30
00:01:31,430 --> 00:01:33,210
Tulis angkanya saja di komentar!

31
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:36,790
Follow untuk matematika sehari-hari lainnya!
